			"notes": "## [3.0.1]\n### Fixed\n- Critical crash when starting without existing worlds\n- Method name typo (`sandConfig2Player` → `sendConfigToPlayer`)\n- Null pointer exceptions during initialization\n- World path resolution in Minecraft 1.21\n\n### Improved\n- Null safety throughout configuration system\n- Automatic fallback to global config\n- Error handling and recovery mechanisms\n- Logging for easier debugging\n\nYou can now use this mod in modpacks without it crashing first time users.\n\nThis is a beta release. Report any bugs [here](https://github.com/MylesGit/AllStackableContinued/issues)."
		}
